<witsml:statusInfo><witsml:reportNo>136</witsml:reportNo><witsml:dTim>2009-03-15T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTim><witsml:md uom="m">3520</witsml:md><witsml:tvd uom="m">3107.4</witsml:tvd><witsml:dTimDiaHoleStart>2009-03-13T15:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimDiaHoleStart><witsml:strengthForm uom="g/cm3">1.6</witsml:strengthForm><witsml:mdStrengthForm uom="m">3116</witsml:mdStrengthForm><witsml:tvdStrengthForm uom="m">2863</witsml:tvdStrengthForm><witsml:mdCsgLast uom="m">3519</witsml:mdCsgLast><witsml:tvdCsgLast uom="m">3107.8</witsml:tvdCsgLast><witsml:presTestType>formation integrity test</witsml:presTestType><witsml:mdPlanned uom="m">-999.99</witsml:mdPlanned><witsml:distDrill uom="m">-999.99</witsml:distDrill><witsml:elevKelly uom="m">54.9</witsml:elevKelly><witsml:wellheadElevation uom="m">138.6</witsml:wellheadElevation><witsml:waterDepth uom="m">91</witsml:waterDepth><witsml:sum24Hr>Operated and greased up leaking PWV. Leak tested XMT cross to 30/200 bar for 5/10 min. Installed WL BOP and riser on XMT. Tested shear seals on WL BOP. Installed combination toolstring in riser. MU lubricator. Leak test WL riser, BOP and lubricator. Equalize and open HMV and DHSV. RIH with combination toolstring and tagged TCP guns at 3260.5 m. Performed correlation log in 7&quot; liner. POOH and prepared for inflow test of HMV.</witsml:sum24Hr><witsml:forecast24Hr>Inflow test HMV to 81-5 bar/10 min. Break lubricator and LD toolstring. Install PLT toolstring in riser. MU lubricator and leak test at in-situ sub. Equalize and open HMV. RIH to perform shut-in station logs and 4 PLT tool calibration passes. Bean up well to 4500 Sm3/day. Perform station logs and 4 high rate flowing PLT passes. Choke back flow to 3000 Sm3/day.</witsml:forecast24Hr><witsml:ropCurrent uom="m/h">-999.99</witsml:ropCurrent><witsml:tightWell>0</witsml:tightWell><witsml:hpht>0</witsml:hpht><witsml:fixedRig>false</witsml:fixedRig></witsml:statusInfo>
